		{"id":"50971a6e822e714e","type":"text","text":"##### **OnCallRAG流程**","x":-180,"y":-220,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"7874d0ef2ea36ee4","type":"text","text":"**告警手册（知识库内容）**","x":-204,"y":-100,"width":228,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"68a6fa377d0eca3b","type":"text","text":"**文档加载组件Loader**","x":-153,"y":40,"width":127,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e50365667ede708a","type":"text","text":"**TransFormer组件**\n1．将文件内容，按照标题#进行切分  \n2．每个切分出来的分片，都赋予一个唯一的uuid\n3．对每个分片都增加元数据信息  \n4．构造返回值，返回","x":-201,"y":160,"width":223,"height":157,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"72ed663392f575f0","type":"text","text":"**文档索引Indexer组件**\n1．首先对所有分片进行向量化，获取向量数组\n2．构造符合milvus表记录的结构体。id、content、vector、metadata\n3．构造完记录后，插入到数据库中。最后返回所有的id","x":-214,"y":393,"width":250,"height":187,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"553ddc9453111d35","type":"file","file":"AI/RAG.md","x":160,"y":40,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"4"}
